**Reviewing isolated worktree strategy**

I'm analyzing how to handle edits within an existing detached worktree, avoiding nested worktrees by using temporary files for simulation. I'll consider preserving original artifacts and adhering to CI's verify-source requirements while limiting actual changes to an allowed whitelist.
